[statement]
A name provided at no version answers an entry whose operator admits an
earlier version: apk installs `a`, which provides `v` at no version, for
`v<3`, as it does for `v<=3` and `v<0`, and refuses `v>=0`, `v=1` and
`v~1`. No version stands below every version.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
k:10
p:v

[request]
v<3

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
